    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This two bedroom property is located in Lawless Terrace, a mature much sought after town centre residential location. Ideally located within very close proximity of Balbriggan town with a host of shops, restaurants, cafes, schools and sports clubs available this would be an ideal starter home or as an investment. It has excellent transport facilities with Iarnroid Eireann train services which run from Dublin to Belfast as well as Dublin Bus and Bus Eireann services. \r\n\r\nThe M1 motorway is a short drive from the subject property providing very easy access to Dublin City Centre, Port tunnel and Dublin International Airport.\r\n \r\nFor the sporting enthusiast, there is an abundance of clubs locally including O’ Dwyer’s GAA club and Glebe North soccer Club in Balbriggan, cricket, rugby and rowing clubs along with the Balbriggan Golf Club that is also located close by. \r\n\r\nIt’s also conveniently situated near the coastal village of Skerries. The beautiful Ardgillan Castle with its spectacular park lands is a few minutes’ drive away providing breathtaking coastal views and it has a state-of-the-art children’s playground on site. \r\n\r\nBalbriggan is home to the Irish Institute of Music and Song and their popular and attractive Lark Theatre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall \t\t\t2.4m x 1.7m\r\nWith carpeted flooring.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\t\t 3.9m x 3.9m\r\nWith carpet flooring and a feature fireplace with an open fire, window to the rear overlooking the garden \r\n\r\nBathroom \t\t3.2m x 2.8m \r\nLarge bathroom with vinyl flooring, WC, wash hand basin and a bath unit\r\n\r\n \r\nKitchen            \t\t5.4m x 2.0m\r\nWith wall and floor units, vinyl flooring, plumbed for a stainless steel sink, washing machine and a fridge freezer. Door to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\n\r\nLanding\t\t\t\t\r\nWith carpeted flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1      \t  \t5.0m x 3.9m\r\nDouble bedroom with carpeted flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 \t\t3.3m x 3.2m\r\nDouble bedroom with carpeted flooring.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\n\r\nFront Garden\r\nWith walls that act as the boundaries, there is a grass area along with mature shrubbery. There is a block wall to the front with a pedestrian gate. \r\n\r\nRear Garden\r\nFence act as the boundaries in the rear garden on one side with a wall on the other. There is a grass area, patio area for al fresco dining along with raised flower beds."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Town centre location\r\nWalking distance to the sandy beaches \r\nFront and rear garden\r\nPotential for extend to the rear subject to PP\r\nOil  central heating\r\nTwo large double bedrooms\r\nOn number 33 bus route, bus stop at the front door \r\nClose to all shops, train station and amenities \r\nRecently painted throughout \r\nNew carpets and flooring"
      },
      {
